---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy — DVR Signal"
  description="DVR Signal Phase 1 privacy model and current collection status."
>
  <div class="container page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Help locally. Collect separately. Publish aggregates only.</h1>
      <p>
        DVR Signal is designed to minimize collection and keep participant-help activity separate
        from any future research survey.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="privacy-grid" aria-label="Privacy model">
      <article>
        <h2>Help tools</h2>
        <p>Inputs remain in browser memory. Local copy, print, or download happens only when you choose it.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Survey</h2>
        <p>No survey collection is active. Any future survey requires separate consent, provider, retention, and access decisions.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Contact information</h2>
        <p>Any optional contact or waitlist function must be stored separately from research responses.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <h2>Public data</h2>
        <p>Phase 1 publication is aggregate-only, with low-count suppression and review against reconstruction risk.</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Current status</h2>
      <p>
        DVR Signal does not currently collect anonymous survey responses, participant accounts,
        medical records, or uploaded case documents.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 19ch;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  }

  .privacy-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .privacy-grid article {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-neutral) 30%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: #fff;
  }

  .privacy-grid h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (min-width: 48rem) {
    .privacy-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
</style>
